Keep on holding me

00:00:00.430 --> 00:00:04.300
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.180
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:00:04.300 --> 00:00:09.180
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:22.000
If I reach out in the light, I can touch

00:00:10.870 --> 00:00:22.000
Hikari no naka ni te wo sashinobaseba todoku

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:27.190
The precious arms

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:27.190
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:32.190
I have been searching for so hard

00:00:27.190 --> 00:00:32.190
Anna ni motomete ita kakegae no nai ude e

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:39.500
I turn around and the sky of blue

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:39.500
Furimukeba kodoku ni wa

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:49.000
Smiles down upon my solitude

00:00:40.340 --> 00:00:49.000
Sora ga aoku hohoende kureru

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:56.250
In the darkness, I nearly lose sight of my dreams

00:00:49.180 --> 00:00:56.250
Kurayami ni yume wo miushinai sou ni naru

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:04.150
But if you remain by my side

00:00:56.790 --> 00:01:04.150
Demo anata ga itekureru no nara

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:08.460
Keep on holding me

00:01:04.730 --> 00:01:08.460
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.130
I listen to your voice in your arms

00:01:08.460 --> 00:01:12.130
Daite ite mune de anata no koe wo kiite iru

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:19.300
I want to protect this love for always

00:01:12.130 --> 00:01:19.300
Itsudemo kono omoi wo mamoritai no

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:24.650
This love...

00:01:19.570 --> 00:01:24.650
Omoi wo

00:01:31.110 --> 00:01:34.610
The Year 2053

00:01:34.690 --> 00:01:38.780
Strife and terrorism spread throughout the entire world.

00:01:38.910 --> 00:01:41.620
The Year 2059

00:01:41.760 --> 00:01:46.460
The twelve leading nations enter into a peace treaty.

00:01:46.580 --> 00:01:50.790
At the same time, 
the GPO is established.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:55.130
However, local conflicts continue.

00:01:55.260 --> 00:02:00.970
Moreover,

00:01:55.260 --> 00:02:00.970
residents in redeveloping areas 
across all nations become unhappy,

00:02:01.140 --> 00:02:03.810
and turn their anger
towards the government.

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:08.140
People begin rioting

00:02:08.290 --> 00:02:10.800
and attack government agencies.

00:02:34.420 --> 00:02:37.590
What the hell are these idiots gathered
around here for? The War's over!

00:02:37.590 --> 00:02:40.180
Why are they getting violent now?
What the hell do they want?

00:02:40.180 --> 00:02:42.600
They've got too much energy
with nothing better to do!

00:02:42.600 --> 00:02:45.850
And they were so damn quiet
during the War too, you know.

00:03:58.000 --> 00:03:59.090
Water.

00:04:06.890 --> 00:04:10.980
We will be arriving shortly.
The squad is also ready to go.

00:04:41.280 --> 00:04:44.660
The Frozen River

00:04:56.660 --> 00:05:00.130
I am actually grateful to you.

00:05:00.130 --> 00:05:03.730
During the Rynax experiment, I made a mistake.

00:05:03.730 --> 00:05:08.280
And as a result, Rynax affected my left arm.

00:05:08.280 --> 00:05:16.220
Not only that, my twin subjects escaped,
which virtually killed the commissioner's plan.

00:05:16.740 --> 00:05:18.280
Yvon Tardieu...

00:05:18.280 --> 00:05:21.780
Windt Delyus, Regel Delyus...

00:05:21.780 --> 00:05:24.450
We can hardly call these experiments successful.

00:05:24.450 --> 00:05:29.390
That is because they've lost their human will,
and are now acting according to the Rynax will.

00:05:29.390 --> 00:05:32.060
People like that are useless to us.

00:05:33.770 --> 00:05:38.850
What we needed was not an uncontrollable Rynax,

00:05:38.850 --> 00:05:43.730
but a controllable Ryna sapien... a human!

00:05:44.040 --> 00:05:46.370
But we couldn't find a way to do that.

00:05:46.370 --> 00:05:50.780
Ryna sapiens develop symptoms which
progress over time, until eventually they die.

00:05:50.780 --> 00:05:54.870
It would be impossible to create an
organization with beings like that.

00:05:55.960 --> 00:05:58.710
However, you made it possible.

00:05:58.710 --> 00:06:03.090
You found a way to return my body to its original state.

00:06:03.090 --> 00:06:06.420
You found a way to treat Ryna sapiens.

00:06:06.420 --> 00:06:11.220
I did not continue my research
for something like that!

00:06:11.670 --> 00:06:13.930
I know that, Dr. Amami.

00:06:15.390 --> 00:06:16.930
How you must despise it...

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:20.770
The Rynax that occupies your daughter's body...

00:06:20.770 --> 00:06:25.510
You wanted to get her body back as soon as you could...

00:06:25.510 --> 00:06:28.480
That's why you've continued your research.

00:06:28.480 --> 00:06:30.950
Then all the more, you must do it now!

00:06:30.950 --> 00:06:34.060
After all, that is why you've kept up your research all this time!

00:06:34.260 --> 00:06:38.500
You must remove that Rynax
from your daughter's body!

00:06:38.500 --> 00:06:39.500
I...

00:06:49.010 --> 00:06:50.570
They're laughing.

00:06:50.910 --> 00:06:52.170
I'm not letting you get away.

00:06:52.170 --> 00:06:54.510
I won't let you do whatever you want any more.

00:06:55.740 --> 00:06:56.520
Ayaka!

00:06:56.850 --> 00:07:00.480
You said they were originally with the GPO, right?

00:07:00.480 --> 00:07:01.310
Night.

00:07:01.310 --> 00:07:03.750
I realize they have Rynax implanted in them,

00:07:03.750 --> 00:07:07.290
but even so, how can they do such
horrible things to a policeman?

00:07:07.290 --> 00:07:11.690
Kurau said that they are acting
solely on the Rynax will.

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:13.530
The Rynax will...

00:07:13.830 --> 00:07:19.540
Rynax can do such horrible things...
hurt people and destroy...

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:24.000
I don't get it! They're so different
from Kurau and Christmas!

00:07:26.630 --> 00:07:28.050
They're over that peak.

00:07:36.100 --> 00:07:37.060
Over there!

00:07:45.520 --> 00:07:46.860
Where's the other guy?

00:07:46.860 --> 00:07:48.070
You mean Regel?

00:07:48.690 --> 00:07:49.660
Gee, I have no idea.

00:07:49.660 --> 00:07:51.030
Don't joke around with me!

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:54.120
I'm going to return you two to the Rynax world!

00:07:54.120 --> 00:07:55.200
Why?

00:07:55.200 --> 00:07:58.580
Many people died because of you two...

00:07:58.580 --> 00:08:01.410
I won't allow you to destroy any more of this world!

00:08:01.410 --> 00:08:04.130
It's not that I want to destroy this world.

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:07.130
I just want to destroy your body a little bit.

00:08:07.780 --> 00:08:09.960
So that the Rynax will pour out of you...

00:08:11.840 --> 00:08:13.260
Aren't you brave...

00:08:32.540 --> 00:08:33.490
Christmas!

00:08:34.200 --> 00:08:35.110
Kurau!

00:08:37.370 --> 00:08:38.660
Christmas!

00:08:46.020 --> 00:08:47.040
Who is that?

00:08:47.040 --> 00:08:49.300
Christmas... it's me...

00:08:49.880 --> 00:08:50.840
Christmas!

00:08:51.760 --> 00:08:54.260
Are you worried about your Pair, Kurau?!

00:09:09.520 --> 00:09:11.570
C-Christmas...

00:09:12.150 --> 00:09:14.710
My little brother will take on your Pair.

00:09:14.720 --> 00:09:17.990
And I'll tear you apart.

00:09:18.650 --> 00:09:20.420
I won't let you do that.

00:09:20.420 --> 00:09:23.460
I won't let the Rynax pour out into this world!

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.870
Don't you understand?

00:09:24.870 --> 00:09:28.830
How dangerous it is for Rynax to come out into this world?

00:09:28.830 --> 00:09:31.000
So many Rynax have already died!

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:33.300
Even then, I don't mind.

00:09:33.300 --> 00:09:36.090
As long as I can experience the joy of coming out!

00:09:46.850 --> 00:09:48.770
I need to save my powers...

00:09:49.080 --> 00:09:50.650
Otherwise, my body will...

00:09:59.730 --> 00:10:00.620
Christmas!

00:10:03.700 --> 00:10:04.370
Kurau!

00:10:08.250 --> 00:10:10.080
Kurau! Where's Christmas?

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:11.810
I can't see from here.

00:10:11.810 --> 00:10:13.710
Doug, stop the car!

00:10:13.710 --> 00:10:15.090
Don't be stupid!

00:10:15.090 --> 00:10:17.220
You're no match for them like that!

00:10:17.220 --> 00:10:18.630
Let me give you a weapon.

00:10:18.630 --> 00:10:19.800
Stop your car!

00:10:22.120 --> 00:10:25.490
Oh no, I'm getting farther and farther away from Christmas.

00:10:25.490 --> 00:10:26.560
I have to get back.

00:10:27.100 --> 00:10:28.190
God, he's persistent!

00:10:32.150 --> 00:10:34.280
What on Earth is this?

00:10:34.610 --> 00:10:37.930
It's Anti-Rynax equipment: the AR system.

00:10:37.930 --> 00:10:40.200
I've heard about this from Kurau.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.370
So this is...

00:10:41.370 --> 00:10:43.530
We have no choice but to rely on this for now.

00:10:44.450 --> 00:10:48.910
Of course, the output has been adjusted, so it won't kill him.

00:10:48.910 --> 00:10:51.920
All right. Show me how to use it.

00:11:13.610 --> 00:11:14.860
Why, Kurau?

00:11:14.860 --> 00:11:16.570
Why do you resist so much?

00:11:16.900 --> 00:11:19.530
Why do you refuse to let the Rynax
spread out into this world?

00:11:19.530 --> 00:11:23.680
I... I can't let them destroy this world...

00:11:23.680 --> 00:11:24.580
That's why...

00:11:24.990 --> 00:11:27.580
I must return you two to the world you came from...

00:11:27.580 --> 00:11:31.620
You're Rynax yourself, aren't you? Yet why?

00:11:31.620 --> 00:11:34.420
That's right. I'm Rynax...

00:11:34.420 --> 00:11:38.630
But I still want to protect this world!

00:11:38.630 --> 00:11:39.510
No matter what!

00:11:39.510 --> 00:11:40.220
Why?

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:43.720
What are you doing? Let go of me!

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:45.470
I'm returning you to the world you came from!

00:11:45.470 --> 00:11:46.640
I won't let you do that.

00:11:59.150 --> 00:12:00.820
You don't have to talk anymore.

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.820
Just let them pour out, Kurau!

00:12:06.530 --> 00:12:07.970
KURAU!

00:12:10.000 --> 00:12:10.790
What?!

00:12:19.340 --> 00:12:20.340
Did I get him?

00:12:26.680 --> 00:12:27.640
Kurau!

00:12:30.220 --> 00:12:31.020
Are you okay?

00:12:31.680 --> 00:12:32.640
Doug...

00:12:33.910 --> 00:12:35.020
Don't be so reckless!

00:12:35.020 --> 00:12:37.820
I'm fine... I really am...

00:12:40.720 --> 00:12:41.620
You used this?!

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:44.570
Don't worry. All I did was knock him out.

00:12:46.630 --> 00:12:49.410
Christmas! Where's Christmas?! Where is she?!

00:12:49.410 --> 00:12:51.620
Ayaka's looking for her now.

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:54.120
I have to save her... Christmas...

00:12:55.200 --> 00:12:58.500
Christmas... Save Christmas...

00:12:59.000 --> 00:13:00.050
Hey, Kurau!

00:13:07.680 --> 00:13:08.430
Kurau...

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:35.870
I can make the Rynax pour out
of you too, you know.

00:13:40.210 --> 00:13:42.000
Keep flying straight ahead.

00:13:42.000 --> 00:13:43.820
Is Christmas there?

00:13:43.820 --> 00:13:45.550
Yes, she's not far away.

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:47.470
How is he doing?

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:50.550
He'd better not get up and cause trouble.

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:53.060
Don't worry. He's sleeping.

00:13:53.060 --> 00:13:55.520
Kurau, what are you planning to do with him?

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:57.560
I will return him to the world he came from.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:01.770
The Rynax is sleeping in him right now... but once he wakes up...

00:14:02.970 --> 00:14:06.860
If you return the Rynax,
then what will happen to him?

00:14:06.860 --> 00:14:08.570
He'll go back to how he was before...

00:14:08.570 --> 00:14:10.320
Back to how he was as a human.

00:14:10.950 --> 00:14:12.160
I see...

00:14:16.460 --> 00:14:19.220
The Rynax can spread out from you...

00:14:19.220 --> 00:14:20.460
isn't that a wonderful thing?

00:14:20.460 --> 00:14:22.710
No! They shouldn't spread!

00:14:22.710 --> 00:14:23.660
Why?

00:14:23.660 --> 00:14:27.430
I didn't know why the Rynax shouldn't spread either.

00:14:27.430 --> 00:14:28.970
But now I do.

00:14:29.430 --> 00:14:34.060
When the Rynax come here,
they take people away from this world.

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:37.600
That's why... It never should have happened...

00:14:37.600 --> 00:14:40.480
I shouldn't have come out into this world either.

00:14:40.480 --> 00:14:42.480
It's too late for that now.

00:14:42.480 --> 00:14:44.980
We're already in this world.

00:14:56.580 --> 00:14:58.160
Let go of me!

00:15:04.710 --> 00:15:05.710
Kurau!

00:15:57.600 --> 00:16:01.230
For me, this world used to be all about Kurau.

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:03.760
But now, there's more.

00:16:03.760 --> 00:16:08.650
There are so many people here
whom I love and who have loved me!

00:16:09.130 --> 00:16:13.990
That's why I want to protect this world, the people I love,

00:16:13.990 --> 00:16:14.870
and Kurau!

00:16:37.510 --> 00:16:38.930
Are you okay, Kurau?

00:16:43.310 --> 00:16:45.100
Kurau! Christmas!

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:48.020
You okay?

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:00.450
It's still warm...

00:17:18.550 --> 00:17:19.390
What's this?!

00:17:28.060 --> 00:17:30.320
You've gotten faster, Regel.

00:17:31.320 --> 00:17:33.400
These memories...

00:17:39.370 --> 00:17:41.660
Are you okay, Regel?

00:17:43.250 --> 00:17:46.790
Regel, stop daydreaming, will ya?

00:17:57.740 --> 00:17:59.720
What was that all about?

00:18:00.810 --> 00:18:04.350
My beloved Windt...

00:18:05.480 --> 00:18:06.690
Windt!

00:18:08.440 --> 00:18:12.900
Let's go back to town for now.
We can't even get a meal out here.

00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:16.190
Besides, we gotta do something about this guy too.

00:18:17.690 --> 00:18:19.900
I wonder if Kurau's okay...

00:18:21.100 --> 00:18:23.660
Yeah, I'm worried, too.

00:18:47.960 --> 00:18:48.980
Christmas...

00:18:51.360 --> 00:18:52.860
'Morning, Kurau.

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:55.230
'Morning, Christmas.

00:19:14.550 --> 00:19:15.340
That's...

00:19:20.220 --> 00:19:21.530
The GPO?!

00:19:29.060 --> 00:19:31.850
Damn it... What the hell...

00:19:31.850 --> 00:19:32.940
We've been surrounded!

00:19:39.860 --> 00:19:42.710
Don't move. Just stay here.
I'll take care of this.

00:19:43.310 --> 00:19:44.410
Hey, Ayaka!

00:20:07.680 --> 00:20:09.890
What's with this combat uniform?

00:20:09.890 --> 00:20:11.390
I've never seen it before.

00:20:12.100 --> 00:20:14.060
I'm Ayaka Steiger.

00:20:14.060 --> 00:20:15.780
You're Detective Steiger?

00:20:15.780 --> 00:20:16.980
That's right.

00:20:16.980 --> 00:20:19.580
I presume your squad is from Headquarters?

00:20:19.580 --> 00:20:21.950
Are you here in pursuit of the twin Ryna sapiens?

00:20:22.980 --> 00:20:25.730
I've captured the older brother.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:29.040
I used the AR system and he's sleeping now.

00:20:29.040 --> 00:20:30.660
I'd like to request transport.

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:32.530
What about the younger brother?

00:20:32.530 --> 00:20:33.870
He's on the loose.

00:20:33.870 --> 00:20:35.460
He should still be in this area.

00:20:36.330 --> 00:20:38.380
I'd like to ask your squad to look for him.

00:20:39.100 --> 00:20:39.880
Radio that in!

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:40.450
Yes, sir!

00:20:42.130 --> 00:20:42.880
Detective...

00:20:44.010 --> 00:20:47.260
Aren't Kurau and her Pair there as well?

00:20:47.980 --> 00:20:50.520
Yes. They are sleeping too.

00:20:50.970 --> 00:20:53.140
I will transport them in my car.

00:20:53.140 --> 00:20:55.850
Where is the Pod to transport the older brother?

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:01.320
The carrier Pod...

00:21:14.160 --> 00:21:17.290
You people... Why have you come?

00:21:17.870 --> 00:21:21.510
What are you here to do?

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:23.760
I am under no obligation to answer you.

00:21:30.930 --> 00:21:31.640
That's...

00:21:34.940 --> 00:21:35.890
Rynax!

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:46.910
From a great distance

00:21:39.980 --> 00:21:46.910
Tooku haruka kanata kara

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
You smile at me

00:21:49.280 --> 00:21:56.250
Kimi ga hohoemu you ni

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.390
The hopelessness that lingers from the past

00:21:58.420 --> 00:22:05.390
Kako kara tsuzuku hakanasa

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:14.470
Is depicted in silence

00:22:07.490 --> 00:22:14.470
Shizuka ni utsushi dasarete

00:22:16.740 --> 00:22:23.710
Moonlight, please never change

00:22:16.740 --> 00:22:23.710
Moonlight kawarazu ni ite

00:22:25.850 --> 00:22:32.820
Moonlight, I'll come to see you

00:22:25.850 --> 00:22:32.820
Moonlight ai ni yuku Kimi ni

00:22:34.990 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight, I'll come running up and surely

00:22:34.990 --> 00:22:41.960
Moonlight kakenobori kitto

00:22:44.100 --> 00:22:51.070
Moonlight, we'll be able to meet again

00:22:44.100 --> 00:22:51.070
Moonlight mou ichido aeru

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:00.280
Moonlight

00:22:53.310 --> 00:23:00.280
Moonlight

00:23:09.950 --> 00:23:11.950
Next Episode

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:13.490
it's flowing into me...

00:23:14.220 --> 00:23:15.330
So warm...

00:23:16.200 --> 00:23:19.210
This is... This is...

00:23:20.540 --> 00:23:21.960
Christmas?

00:23:21.960 --> 00:23:24.920
Shine In The Darkness
